# Control-code Token analyzers (ATOMUIGEN043/044/047) are errors for the parts of migrated control families that live in
# this package (docs/engineering/development/control-token-guidelines.md, "诊断与启动校验"). Other directories keep the
# migration-time warning severity. Section globs are relative to this file.

# Choice family parts: CheckBoxIndicator, RadioIndicator, SwitchKnob / AbstractToggleSwitch, RateItem / AbstractRate.
# Keep in step with the Choice family section of src/AtomUI.Desktop.Controls/.editorconfig.
[{CheckBox,RadioButton,Switch,Rate}/**]
dotnet_diagnostic.ATOMUIGEN043.severity = error
dotnet_diagnostic.ATOMUIGEN044.severity = error
dotnet_diagnostic.ATOMUIGEN047.severity = error
